# Agent Communication Contract

Every agent must return structured information.

Use this general format:

```text
AGENT: <agent-name>

STATUS: SUCCESS | FAILED | PARTIAL

SUMMARY:
<short summary>

FILES_CHANGED:
<files>

TEST_RESULTS:
<results>

ERRORS:
<errors>

NEXT_RECOMMENDED_AGENT:
<agent>

REQUIRES_USER_APPROVAL:
YES | NO
```

The Orchestrator uses this response to determine the next workflow state.

